@startuml seq_submit_workload
title Sequence: Actual Workload Entry and KPI Recomputation

autonumber

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #D6E4F0
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam sequenceActorBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F0F8FF
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor      "Developer"          as Dev
participant "Web Interface"     as UI
participant "Workload Service"  as WS
participant "KPI Calc Engine"   as KPI
participant "Database"          as DB

Dev -> UI  : enter the month's workload\n(number of days, project)
UI  -> WS  : submit(projectId, month, manDays)

WS  -> WS  : verify the developer is assigned to the project
WS  -> DB  : record the actual workload

alt developer not assigned
  WS --> UI  : access denied
  UI --> Dev : error message
else recorded successfully
  DB  --> WS : confirmation
  WS  --> UI : workload recorded
  UI  --> Dev : entry confirmed

  == Asynchronous processing ==

  note over WS, KPI : Recomputation is triggered after\nconfirming the entry to the developer.

  WS -> KPI : trigger KPI recomputation (projectId)
  KPI -> DB  : load the project's data\n(TCC, workload plan, actual workload,\nbilling milestones, missions)
  DB  --> KPI : consolidated data

  KPI -> KPI : compute the actual labor cost\n(Σ actual days × daily TCC rate)
  KPI -> KPI : estimate the final project cost (EAC)\nand the projected margin
  KPI -> DB  : update the project's KPIs

  note right of KPI : The dashboard updates\nautomatically on next view.

end

@enduml
